00:31:26,408 --> 00:31:27,769
[SPEAKER_02]: Well, that's mindful reflection.

370
00:31:28,009 --> 00:31:30,370
[SPEAKER_02]: It's inseparable.

371
00:31:30,571 --> 00:31:31,771
[SPEAKER_02]: Sati, recollectedness.

372
00:31:33,292 --> 00:31:35,214
[SPEAKER_02]: Sati, sampajañña, mindfulness and awareness.

373
00:31:35,474 --> 00:31:37,275
[SPEAKER_02]: Sati is the same word used for memory.

374
00:31:42,138 --> 00:31:49,703
[SPEAKER_02]: So, that's the whole, the whole, this whole misconception of kind of observing the external moment, chasing them, being fast, quick, grasping.

375
00:31:50,184 --> 00:31:51,845
[SPEAKER_02]: It's a completely misguided view.

